## 35. Fault-injection tests

Where safe and feasible, deliberately test:

- Missing assets.
- Invalid save data.
- Rapid repeated input.
- Pausing during an active mission.
- Resetting while a vehicle is moving.
- NPCs blocked by obstacles.
- Police losing sight of the player.
- Collisions at different speeds.
- Browser tab suspension during gameplay.
- Restarting after a failed mission.
- High NPC counts.
- Extended gameplay sessions.

The objective is to expose genuine defects, not merely to demonstrate the expected path.

